I'm running OSF V4D on a number of DEC alphas. Since 2 weeks these
systems for some reason
can no longer access the internet outside our institute, saying the
network is unreachable.
I can remedy it by issuing the command: route add default <ip-address of
gateway>.
This adds the gateway to the routing tables, but after a reboot the
